--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications in this fork
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is NOT the upstream Lucebox. It adds multi-node expert-parallel execution
of DeepSeek V4 across several AMD Strix Halo machines connected by RoCE v2
RDMA, using RCCL. Changes relative to upstream are kept additive and live in:

  server/src/cluster/                 cluster runtime (control channel, RCCL
                                      communicator, expert placement, hooks)
  server/deps/patches/cluster/        patch series with every modification to
                                      the vendored ggml (see README.md there)
  scripts/cluster/                    host preparation, launch, baseline and
                                      build helpers
  Dockerfile.rocm-cluster, docker-bake.hcl (rocm-cluster targets), Makefile
  server/docs/CLUSTER.md              operator guide
  .github/workflows/cluster-ci.yml    fork-only CI

Build option: -DDFLASH27B_CLUSTER=ON. With the option OFF the sources are
intended to be functionally identical to upstream Lucebox.

